sub auth | Manage authentication
sub run | Run a command or script
sub init | Create a new project
sub add | Add dependencies to the project
sub remove | Remove dependencies from the project
sub version | Read or update the project's version
sub sync | Update the project's environment
sub lock | Update the project's lockfile
sub export | Export the project's lockfile to an alternate format
sub tree | Display the project's dependency tree
sub format | Format Python code in the project
sub check | Run checks on the project
sub audit | Audit the project's dependencies
sub tool | Run and install commands provided by Python packages
sub python | Manage Python versions and installations
sub pip | Manage Python packages with a pip-compatible interface
sub venv | Create a virtual environment
sub build | Build Python packages into source distributions and wheels
sub publish | Upload distributions to an index
sub workspace | Inspect uv workspaces
sub cache | Manage uv's cache
sub self | Manage the uv executable
sub help | Display documentation for a command
flag -n --no-cache | Avoid reading from or writing to the cache, instead using a
flag --cache-dir arg=dir | Path to the cache directory [env: UV_CACHE_DIR=]
flag --managed-python | Require use of uv-managed Python versions [env: UV_MANAGED_P
flag --no-managed-python | Disable use of uv-managed Python versions [env: UV_NO_MANAGE
flag --no-python-downloads | Disable automatic downloads of Python. [env: "UV_PYTHON_DOWN
flag -q --quiet global | Use quiet output
flag -v --verbose global | Use verbose output
flag --color arg=values:auto,always,never global | Control the use of color in output [possible values: auto, a
flag --system-certs global | Whether to load TLS certificates from the platform's native
flag --offline global | Disable network access [env: UV_OFFLINE=]
flag --allow-insecure-host arg=none global | Allow insecure connections to a host [env: UV_INSECURE_HOST=
flag --no-progress global | Hide all progress outputs [env: UV_NO_PROGRESS=]
flag --directory arg=dir global | Change to the given directory prior to running the command [
flag --project arg=none global | Discover a project in the given directory [env: UV_PROJECT=]
flag --config-file arg=path global | The path to a `uv.toml` file to use for configuration [env:
flag --no-config global | Avoid discovering configuration files (`pyproject.toml`, `uv
flag -h --help global | Display the concise help for this command
flag -V --version global | Display the uv version
